# OpenAPI Generated Files Policy

- Never manually edit files under `react/src/api/gen/**`.
- If generated code appears wrong, first run the project generation command (`yarn openapi-gen` in `react/`).
- If the issue persists after regeneration, trace and fix the source in the backend Python OpenAPI/schema definitions.
- Regenerate client artifacts after backend schema changes; do not patch generated outputs directly.
- Treat manual edits in generated files as invalid changes that must be replaced by regeneration.
